  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第十五关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "快藏起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "我......我必須走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "這個......這個，給你們。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "這是我們的護身符，是我媽媽親手教我做的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "給你們的這個是我做的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "親手做的布偶，能保證重要的人平安無事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩們",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯，米莎姐姐，我們會好好保管它的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1#3",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "真乖。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "米莎",
      "speakerToken": "char_012_misa_1",
      "operatorId": "char_012_misa",
      "portraitKey": "char_012_misa",
      "text": "藏好！別出聲。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩們",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "往哪去了？！你們，追！看那些感染者還能跑多遠！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "嗯？這裡......看來還有些東西呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......依據能天使的情報，任務目標一定在這附近逗留過才對......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "啊啊，這裡的地形真是很複雜，光憑羅德島，這個任務果然也有些麻煩呢......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "幸好聯繫了企鵝物流......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......有人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這些人是......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "壞蛋！你們這些壞蛋！放開我！放——開——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "說！她往哪跑了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別不知好歹！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "龍姐姐！龍姐姐！你在哪裡！救命啊——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "米莎姐姐！米莎姐姐，救救我！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "誰？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "別想走！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......我勸你們，立刻離開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "......？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你——？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "哪裡來的外地人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "你就不怕我們......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "否則——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "咕啊！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "那，那是什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "法術！她，她在使用法術？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "啊啊啊！別過來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——以後別再做些欺壓弱小的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "暴民",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "呃呃啊，怪物！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "呵......怪物......嗎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "好啦，沒事了，都出來吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這裡危險，快去安全點的地方吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "小孩們",
      "speakerToken": null,
      "operatorId": null,
      "portraitKey": null,
      "text": "謝謝你，兔姐姐！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "都小心點啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "阿米婭，這是什麼情況？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "嗯，我看見了一個，應該也是未登記的感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "烏薩斯人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是的，烏薩斯人，她往貧民區更深處去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "芙蘭卡，讓附近參與搜查的幹員集合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "Ok。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "越往貧民區前進，形勢就越複雜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "一般居民，犯罪分子，未確認身份的流民......層出不窮。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "必須多加準備才行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "有通訊，阿米婭。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "請稍等一下。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米婭，是近衛局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是陳長官？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "沒錯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——是的，我們已經搜查出了不少非登記感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——什麼？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——白色短髮，烏薩斯人，少年女性，身高一米四五左右，名叫米莎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這是——？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "——明白。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米婭，陳長官要求我們，立即搜查具備這種特徵的感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "一經發現，立刻交給近衛局。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "請給我一下通訊設備。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "喂，喂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官，你聽得到嗎？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我聽得到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我能否確認下，剛才你下達命令的有效性？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "真實可靠，立刻執行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "突然就掛斷了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
      "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
      "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
      "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
      "text": "陳長官，好硬的脾氣啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那這就是我們接下來所要執行的任務了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "阿米婭......幾位重裝幹員向我發來了另一條通訊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "他們遭遇了對羅德島幹員展現出攻擊傾向的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
      "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
      "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
      "text": "而且，那些襲擊者不是普通人，他們是......感染者。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......讓重裝幹員們向我們目前所在的區域撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "偵察小隊！去追蹤任務目標，白髮烏薩斯少女，身高1.45米，務必注意隱蔽和安全！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "其他幹員，跟隨各自的隊長散開。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "以逸待勞，很好。",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "這是......誘敵深入？",
          "value": "2",
          "blocks": []
        },
        {
          "label": "芙蘭卡小姐，我們是不是要伏擊敵人？",
          "value": "3",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ],
      "sharedBlocks": [
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
          "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
          "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "喲——不錯嘛。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "芙蘭卡",
          "speakerToken": "char_106_franka_1",
          "operatorId": "char_106_franka",
          "portraitKey": "char_106_franka",
          "text": "雷蛇，這孩子很聰明呢。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "雷蛇",
          "speakerToken": "char_107_liskam_1",
          "operatorId": "char_107_liskam",
          "portraitKey": "char_107_liskam",
          "text": "......Dr.{@nickname}可是戰術指揮官，你嚴肅點。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "行動吧。"
        },
        {
          "type": "dialogue",
          "speakerName": "阿米婭",
          "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#4",
          "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
          "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
          "text": "攻擊羅德島的感染者......嗎。"
        },
